  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Clear operational reading",
    "overview": "AVNES uses its existing blue accent, neutral surfaces and Geist typography for a restrained Spanish-language administration interface. Borders establish structure; color and weight distinguish actions, measures and state. The user retained the palette and delegated dashboard composition.\n\nThis record captures existing global tokens and the shipped admin/coordinator dashboard only. Operate is the mode of the dashboard surface brief, not a new identity imposed on every screen. The mentor dashboard and other screens were not redesigned by this work. No image composition was approved and no new imagery was introduced.",
